#: ../../packages/legal/src/PrivacyAnalytics.tsx#PrivacyAnalytics
msgid ""
"Rybbit operates without cookies and without persistent identifiers. To count "
"unique visitors, Rybbit generates a pseudonymised hash from the IP address and"
" user agent. The IP address is processed only transiently in working memory "
"for hash generation and is never permanently stored or logged. A daily "
"rotating random component (salt) resets this identifier every day, so tracking"
" across days is ruled out."
msgstr ""
"Rybbit operates without cookies and without persistent identifiers. To count "
"unique visitors, Rybbit generates a pseudonymised hash from the IP address and"
" user agent. The IP address is processed only transiently in working memory "
"for hash generation and is never permanently stored or logged. A daily "
"rotating random component (salt) resets this identifier every day, so tracking"
" across days is ruled out."

